nodes.body:
Rebased onto main at 4137d89. The `MIN_BASE_SHA` gate from #21065 passes now, so CI can run once someone adds `run-ci`.

@JustinTong0323 you own `srt/parser` in CODEOWNERS. @slin1237 adding you as the area Merge Oncall, since the bot did not assign one here.

The change moves two `mimo` entries below the marker-based detectors. `mimo` keys on `enable_thinking | default(false)` alone, so it masked MiniMax M3, MiniMax, Step 3.5, Step 3, DeepSeek V4, and Qwen3 Coder. Tests cover all six.

Rebased again at 905a25f8. The #21065 gate moved to a5f07b12, which left the earlier rebase stale. The branch now sits ahead of it, 0 behind.

@Kangyan-Zhou @Fridge003 you own CI and Release in MAINTAINER.md, and this needs a `run-ci` label to get any signal. I asked JustinTong0323, slin1237, ch-wan and ispobock earlier; no label yet.

The change moves two `mimo` entries below the marker-based detectors and adds tests for the six templates it was masking. chilltongx approved on Aug 22.

